WEBVTT

01:32.336 --> 01:36.856
(Zhan Zhao Adventures)

01:36.969 --> 01:39.869
(Episode 30)

01:40.352 --> 01:41.416
Think carefully.

01:41.872 --> 01:43.279
Did you do something back then

01:43.552 --> 01:45.279
that would make him want to silence you for good?

01:46.672 --> 01:47.696
That year,

01:47.873 --> 01:50.073
after I buried my niece's body,

01:50.153 --> 01:51.478
I left home to do business.

01:51.832 --> 01:53.238
I was always traveling around,

01:53.712 --> 01:55.513
all these years, I barely ever went back home.

01:55.593 --> 01:57.593
I definitely didn't have any dealings with the Zhao family.

01:59.153 --> 02:01.238
I really can't think of anything.

02:06.593 --> 02:08.112
Looking at these fine clothes you're wearing,

02:08.192 --> 02:09.558
your business must be pretty big.

02:11.472 --> 02:14.278
I just trade some medicinal herbs.

02:14.712 --> 02:16.193
Whatever the mountains produce,

02:16.273 --> 02:17.416
that's what I sell.

02:18.593 --> 02:19.913
Thank you, Lord Zhan

02:19.993 --> 02:21.878
and everyone here, for saving my life today.

02:22.193 --> 02:23.553
I have urgent matters to handle,

02:23.633 --> 02:25.199
so I'll take my leave.

02:25.752 --> 02:26.935
Goodbye.

02:27.292 --> 02:28.333
Please stay here.

02:32.472 --> 02:34.238
He's definitely hiding something.

02:34.752 --> 02:36.473
Should we call him back and keep questioning him?

02:36.553 --> 02:38.119
I'm afraid he still won't tell the truth.

02:39.712 --> 02:42.033
For Luo Chang Shui to risk getting caught

02:42.113 --> 02:44.193
and commit murder in broad daylight,

02:44.273 --> 02:45.558
whatever Zhong Shou is hiding

02:46.232 --> 02:48.039
must be connected to Luo Chang Shui's boss

02:48.553 --> 02:49.798
in some way.

02:58.152 --> 03:00.312
Waiter. The bill, please.

03:23.458 --> 03:24.792
Remember to take your medicine on time.

03:24.875 --> 03:26.259
Come see me after you finish this batch.

03:26.542 --> 03:27.542
Thank you, physician.

03:28.583 --> 03:29.583
All right.

03:30.232 --> 03:32.273
Wait. That's too much.

03:33.473 --> 03:34.473
Sure.

03:56.113 --> 03:57.479
Is this deal confirmed?

03:58.432 --> 03:59.576
If everything's good,

03:59.793 --> 04:01.232
I'm about to go all in.

04:01.312 --> 04:02.312
Go for it.

04:02.513 --> 04:03.838
This order is urgent.

04:04.750 --> 04:06.557
Do you think I'd pay you less?

04:07.614 --> 04:09.352
Her parents are here with me, crying their eyes out.

04:09.432 --> 04:11.152
I have to figure out a way to get them out of here.

04:11.833 --> 04:12.833
All right.

04:14.113 --> 04:15.113
Let's get started.

04:29.192 --> 04:31.192
Once her parents take the body back home,

04:31.432 --> 04:32.576
you go over there a bit later.

04:33.273 --> 04:35.913
Last time, the body wasn't even cold yet and you already rushed in.

04:35.993 --> 04:38.232
If someone gets suspicious, we're done for.

04:38.312 --> 04:39.559
Don't lecture me.

04:39.912 --> 04:41.056
I know what I'm doing.

04:41.432 --> 04:43.352
Hurry up and go pry her mouth open.

04:43.432 --> 04:44.798
Don't mess it up like last time.

04:45.513 --> 04:47.118
She bit down on my hand and wouldn't let go.

04:55.032 --> 04:56.032
Sit tight.

05:00.953 --> 05:01.953
Miss,

05:03.032 --> 05:04.056
I'm really sorry.

05:04.993 --> 05:07.552
If you want to blame someone, blame your own bad luck.

05:07.632 --> 05:09.159
You just had to pick this clinic.

05:09.472 --> 05:10.832
But don't worry.

05:10.912 --> 05:13.593
The groom I picked for you is only about 25 or 26.

05:13.673 --> 05:15.159
That's a good match for you.

05:15.673 --> 05:17.593
Down in the afterlife, you two can live well together.

05:17.673 --> 05:18.673
Hurry up and pour it in.

05:22.752 --> 05:23.752
Stop!

05:31.793 --> 05:32.935
Can this girl be saved?

05:33.393 --> 05:34.393
Yes.

05:34.592 --> 05:35.592
She can be saved.

05:39.113 --> 05:40.113
Back then,

05:40.432 --> 05:42.392
there was a family around Xiangzhou

05:42.472 --> 05:44.439
who wanted a ghost marriage for their son.

05:44.712 --> 05:46.999
They offered a high price for a young woman's body.

05:47.472 --> 05:48.832
They'd pay two hundred taels.

05:48.912 --> 05:50.352
At the time, I thought,

05:50.432 --> 05:52.033
Jin Niang really had a tough life.

05:52.113 --> 05:54.352
I heard her husband went to work in the mountains,

05:54.432 --> 05:56.352
but he vanished without a trace.

05:56.432 --> 05:58.153
So, finding her a companion wasn't a bad idea.

05:58.233 --> 06:01.718
At least, she wouldn't be bullied in the afterlife.

06:01.977 --> 06:03.679
So, I sold Jin Niang's body

06:03.993 --> 06:05.016
to them.

06:05.312 --> 06:06.312
You...

06:09.593 --> 06:10.593
Keep talking.

06:11.952 --> 06:13.752
Later, I realized

06:13.832 --> 06:16.278
families around here really cared about ghost marriages.

06:16.625 --> 06:18.042
This kind of deal costs nothing up front

06:18.118 --> 06:20.393
and makes money way faster than a regular business.

06:20.473 --> 06:23.119
So, I... I started doing this for a living.

06:24.033 --> 06:25.278
If it's just for ghost marriages,

06:25.713 --> 06:27.073
why did you have to kill?

06:27.153 --> 06:29.432
Young women's bodies are too hard to find.

06:29.512 --> 06:32.273
So, I teamed up with the clinic's doctor,

06:32.353 --> 06:33.353
and the two of us...

06:33.583 --> 06:34.606
Please spare me, Lord Hu!

06:34.872 --> 06:36.016
Have mercy, Lord Hu!

06:36.583 --> 06:39.002
I was just confused for a moment, that's why I made such a huge mistake.

06:39.952 --> 06:41.792
I'm one of your citizens in Wanshan County.

06:41.872 --> 06:43.473
Please show some mercy, Lord Hu.

06:43.553 --> 06:45.638
Please, Lord Hu, have mercy!

06:46.353 --> 06:47.432
Dealing in corpses

06:47.512 --> 06:49.633
and desecrating the dead goes against all human decency.

06:49.713 --> 06:51.512
Killing for this is truly unforgivable.

06:51.752 --> 06:53.312
In my jurisdiction,

06:53.392 --> 06:55.552
there are still criminals like you.

06:55.632 --> 06:58.078
Even death punishment wouldn't satisfy my anger

06:58.553 --> 07:00.278
and you still try to make excuses for yourself?

07:01.113 --> 07:02.113
Zhong Shou.

07:02.665 --> 07:05.025
How many people have you killed? Tell the truth.

07:05.125 --> 07:06.370
Just one.

07:07.312 --> 07:08.513
Still not telling the truth?

07:08.593 --> 07:10.655
With the way you do things, this can't be your first time.

07:10.952 --> 07:13.295
If you keep lying, you'll be tortured.

07:13.673 --> 07:15.352
No! I'll talk!

07:15.432 --> 07:16.999
I'll tell the truth, sir!

07:17.312 --> 07:18.679
I killed

07:19.673 --> 07:20.673
nine.

07:24.192 --> 07:25.192
Were they all young women?

07:27.473 --> 07:28.958
They were all young women.

07:29.353 --> 07:30.992
The families arranging ghost marriages

07:31.072 --> 07:32.713
are usually for young men who died early.

07:32.793 --> 07:34.633
They died before they could get married.

07:34.713 --> 07:36.593
That's why the families are willing to pay so much

07:36.673 --> 07:38.312
to find a wife for the dead.

07:38.392 --> 07:39.638
Where did you commit these crimes?

07:41.392 --> 07:42.879
Yicheng, for one.

07:43.473 --> 07:44.799
Sui County, too.

07:45.192 --> 07:47.312
This is only my second time here in Wanshan County.

07:47.392 --> 07:49.473
- Only?   - No, that's not it.

07:49.553 --> 07:51.776
You've already caused a death in Wanshan County.

07:51.857 --> 07:53.268
Have both of them sign their confessions.

07:53.349 --> 07:54.554
Once we find the victims' families,

07:54.634 --> 07:56.600
and the case has been reviewed, they'll be executed immediately.

07:56.681 --> 07:58.241
Sir, I was wrong!

07:58.322 --> 07:59.323
Please spare me, Lord Hu!

07:59.404 --> 08:01.444
Lord Zhan, have mercy! Spare me, please!

08:01.525 --> 08:03.931
- Sir, have mercy!   - Sir, I was wrong!

08:43.432 --> 08:45.816
Who did you sell Jin Niang's body to?

08:46.673 --> 08:49.598
Are you planning to bring back the dead body

08:49.872 --> 08:51.192
and return it to the Duan family?

08:51.272 --> 08:53.038
You sold her like she was just an object.

08:53.553 --> 08:55.278
But I still see her as a person.

08:55.793 --> 08:57.879
- Speak up!   - I'll talk!

08:58.473 --> 09:01.439
It was someone from Gucheng County named Lu Zhu.

09:01.872 --> 09:03.816
Ask around over there, and you'll find out.

09:07.233 --> 09:08.233
Don't be afraid.

09:08.673 --> 09:09.855
Just answer honestly,

09:10.153 --> 09:11.398
and you won't be tortured.

09:12.353 --> 09:14.872
There are still things you haven't explained clearly in court.

09:14.952 --> 09:16.095
I did say it.

09:16.432 --> 09:17.593
I've told you everything I know.

09:17.673 --> 09:18.896
I'm not hiding anything.

09:19.113 --> 09:20.810
So, was all your business selling women's bodies

09:21.458 --> 09:22.984
around Xiangzhou?

09:23.353 --> 09:24.535
You never did it anywhere else?

09:25.072 --> 09:26.478
It happens in other counties too,

09:26.832 --> 09:28.153
but it's pretty rare.

09:28.233 --> 09:30.319
In a few years, there might only be one deal.

09:30.793 --> 09:32.593
Only around Xiangzhou is it common

09:32.673 --> 09:33.953
for young men to die unexpectedly,

09:34.033 --> 09:35.310
so there's a need for ghost marriages.

09:36.192 --> 09:37.192
Where in Xiangzhou

09:37.593 --> 09:39.119
were these men from?

09:40.392 --> 09:43.359
They were from Yi County,

09:43.553 --> 09:44.776
Yunmeng County,

09:45.272 --> 09:46.295
Gucheng County,

09:46.632 --> 09:48.919
and also Wanshan County.

09:49.512 --> 09:50.513
A few years ago,

09:50.593 --> 09:53.232
there could be six or seven deals in a single year.

09:53.312 --> 09:56.975
But now, only Wanshan County has any business left.

09:57.353 --> 09:59.158
Is there a lot of business in Wanshan County?

10:00.392 --> 10:02.513
It was decent a couple of years ago.

10:02.593 --> 10:05.559
But these past two years, it's gotten less and less.

10:12.353 --> 10:14.816
You gave the doctor a hundred taels of silver.

10:15.435 --> 10:17.014
The people who come to you for ghost marriages,

10:17.113 --> 10:18.336
are they all from wealthy families?

10:19.632 --> 10:20.632
No.

10:20.792 --> 10:22.273
Judging by their clothes,

10:22.353 --> 10:24.159
they're definitely not rich.

10:24.672 --> 10:27.639
But they're actually pretty generous when it comes to money.

10:27.912 --> 10:29.878
They'd pay at least a hundred or two hundred taels.

10:31.152 --> 10:33.353
Who's the latest person who came to you?

10:33.433 --> 10:34.433
Where do they live?

10:35.512 --> 10:38.039
His name was Wang Heng.

10:38.292 --> 10:42.413
He said the ghost marriage was for his younger brother, Wang Qing.

10:42.473 --> 10:44.353
They live in Wanshan County.

10:44.433 --> 10:46.639
But I don't know exactly where he lives.

10:46.993 --> 10:49.878
Because we always talked at the inn, never anywhere else.

11:05.433 --> 11:08.159
Is there anything else about this case that you want to ask about?

11:08.392 --> 11:10.936
This man killed for money and was caught red-handed.

11:11.313 --> 11:13.233
The stolen silver from the inn was also recovered.

11:13.313 --> 11:14.432
We caught him with the loot.

11:14.512 --> 11:15.838
There's no way he's being framed.

11:16.713 --> 11:18.199
It's not that I think he's innocent.

11:18.833 --> 11:20.855
It's just this case still feels off.

11:21.953 --> 11:23.072
Don't you think it's strange that

11:23.152 --> 11:25.512
so many young men have died unexpectedly

11:25.792 --> 11:26.855
in one year?

11:28.953 --> 11:31.319
You just got here, so you don't know the situation yet.

11:31.912 --> 11:32.936
All these cases

11:33.912 --> 11:35.519
were committed by the Xiuluo Sect.

11:36.953 --> 11:37.953
Xiuluo Sect?

11:39.713 --> 11:42.233
The Xiuluo Sect is ruthless and tests poisons on living people.

11:42.313 --> 11:45.039
And sometimes, they even perform live sacrifice rituals.

11:45.552 --> 11:48.233
A few years ago, they made life miserable for the people.

11:48.313 --> 11:51.559
After I took office, the first thing I did was to wipe out their followers.

11:51.953 --> 11:54.958
In recent years, they've rarely shown up in Wanshan County.

11:55.193 --> 11:56.193
But now,

11:56.713 --> 11:58.192
some must have slipped through the cracks

11:58.272 --> 11:59.639
so they're making a comeback.

12:00.064 --> 12:01.672
I need to step up patrols.

12:01.752 --> 12:03.319
We can't let more people get hurt.

12:03.953 --> 12:05.799
But if Wang Qing was murdered,

12:06.272 --> 12:07.799
why didn't his family report it?

12:08.473 --> 12:09.473
Also,

12:09.872 --> 12:11.513
the families arranging these ghost marriages

12:11.593 --> 12:13.536
can easily come up with hundreds of taels of silver.

12:14.833 --> 12:16.056
That's pretty suspicious too.

12:18.073 --> 12:19.192
Judging by your look,

12:19.272 --> 12:22.238
you won't rest until you get answers.

12:23.125 --> 12:24.672
Elder Zhu is in charge of the household registry.

12:24.753 --> 12:27.402
He should know where Wang Qing's family lives.

12:27.483 --> 12:28.523
Ask him for the address

12:28.604 --> 12:29.783
and go check it out yourself.

12:31.152 --> 12:32.153
Thank you, Lord Hu.

12:32.233 --> 12:33.712
I'm just worried about your health,

12:33.792 --> 12:35.958
that you can't handle all this stress and running around.

12:37.032 --> 12:38.032
Don't worry.

12:38.193 --> 12:39.193
I'm fine.

12:40.152 --> 12:41.519
Wang Qing's house is just up ahead.

13:15.552 --> 13:16.998
That must be last night's leftovers.

13:17.272 --> 13:18.467
It's already starting to smell bad.

13:19.433 --> 13:20.679
All their luggage is gone.

13:21.073 --> 13:22.838
Looks like they got word last night

13:23.233 --> 13:24.233
and left in a hurry.

13:25.272 --> 13:26.678
As soon as Zhong Shou Gang gave up Wang Qing,

13:26.759 --> 13:28.205
the Wang family left town that night.

13:28.313 --> 13:29.494
Does that mean

13:30.433 --> 13:31.878
there's a mole in the county office?

13:34.872 --> 13:37.032
This is bad. We need to get back immediately.

14:22.944 --> 14:24.855
Back in the courtroom just now, in front of outsiders,

14:24.936 --> 14:27.360
I kept our county's secrets completely to myself.

14:36.353 --> 14:38.478
I didn't see anything.

14:38.833 --> 14:40.358
I swear, I won't tell anyone.

14:40.593 --> 14:42.712
Please, I'm begging you. Don't kill me.

14:42.792 --> 14:44.053
I really didn't see anything.

14:44.134 --> 14:45.520
I swear I won't say a word.

15:04.912 --> 15:05.912
Wait.

15:38.713 --> 15:40.712
The killer was quick and efficient.

15:40.792 --> 15:42.358
Both victims were killed in a single move.

15:44.113 --> 15:46.312
Hu, there's no one else here

15:46.392 --> 15:47.576
so I'll just speak plainly.

15:47.953 --> 15:50.113
The killer knew the guards' shift schedules

15:50.193 --> 15:52.672
and struck when the fewest people were on duty.

15:52.752 --> 15:54.159
It doesn't seem like an outsider did this.

15:57.473 --> 15:59.672
Bai, I get what you're saying.

15:59.752 --> 16:01.153
But I can promise you,

16:01.233 --> 16:03.592
my men would never do something like this.

16:03.672 --> 16:05.192
Besides, they have keys.

16:05.272 --> 16:07.312
If they wanted in, they wouldn't need to go through all this trouble.

16:07.392 --> 16:09.118
The killer probably set this up to throw us off.

16:09.473 --> 16:10.753
I checked the bodies.

16:10.833 --> 16:12.199
There were no signs of resistance.

16:12.953 --> 16:15.473
That means they weren't on guard against whoever came in.

16:15.593 --> 16:16.993
We just went to Wang Qing's house.

16:17.073 --> 16:18.913
They'd already packed up their things and left.

16:18.993 --> 16:21.392
This probably can't just be called a coincidence, can it?

16:25.713 --> 16:27.312
I'm honestly feeling pretty troubled.

16:27.392 --> 16:29.713
That's why I came to find you just to talk.

16:30.113 --> 16:33.478
Fine. Today, I guess I'll sacrifice to keep you company.

16:34.193 --> 16:35.962
You'd better make sure you stay alive.

16:36.043 --> 16:37.243
This wine isn't cheap, you know.

16:37.353 --> 16:38.598
I didn't get any for you today.

16:39.073 --> 16:40.073
Here you go.

16:45.193 --> 16:46.193
Zhan.

16:54.792 --> 16:56.358
I get why you all have doubts.

16:56.872 --> 17:00.696
But my men have been with me since I took office.

17:01.233 --> 17:05.272
They fought by my side when we took down the Xiuluo Sect.

17:05.872 --> 17:07.056
I trust them,

17:07.433 --> 17:10.159
just like you trust the two friends by your side.

17:11.233 --> 17:13.193
I really don't want to admit they might be involved.

17:16.672 --> 17:18.753
But with all these murders happening,

17:18.833 --> 17:21.559
and every lead you find gets cut off cleanly,

17:22.353 --> 17:23.878
even if I don't want to face it,

17:24.129 --> 17:25.329
I can't deny

17:25.410 --> 17:27.496
the fact that there's trouble brewing underneath

17:27.953 --> 17:30.118
Wanshan County, which may look peaceful on the surface.

17:31.752 --> 17:33.639
Qiu Han is one of Prince Xiangyang's men.

17:33.872 --> 17:35.358
You came to Wanshan County this time

17:35.552 --> 17:37.639
to root out Prince Xiangyang's faction,

17:37.833 --> 17:38.833
didn't you?

17:39.193 --> 17:40.193
Xiao Chen,

17:40.953 --> 17:42.718
how did you know about this?

17:44.632 --> 17:47.472
I've been riding the waves in the Xiangzhou bureaucracy for about a decade.

17:47.552 --> 17:49.718
All I've done is circle around tiny, insignificant positions.

17:49.953 --> 17:51.878
Why do you think I've never been promoted?

17:56.233 --> 17:58.238
You refused to go along with Prince Xiangyang's people,

17:59.208 --> 18:00.458
to get mixed up in their corruption.

18:02.073 --> 18:03.353
I willingly came

18:03.433 --> 18:05.872
to what was then a poor and remote Wanshan County.

18:06.032 --> 18:08.439
It took a lot of work to turn it into what it is today.

18:08.833 --> 18:09.833
But I never thought

18:10.113 --> 18:12.078
I'd still have to deal with Prince Xiangyang's faction.

18:12.953 --> 18:14.472
After the Jin Xue Wen case,

18:14.552 --> 18:16.519
the court sent an imperial envoy to Xiangzhou.

18:16.752 --> 18:18.799
Now every official, big or small, is worried for themselves.

18:19.552 --> 18:21.593
Of course, I knew what you were investigating.

18:22.833 --> 18:25.998
Zhan Zhao, this little Wanshan County is all I have.

18:26.233 --> 18:28.279
It's the result of all my hard work.

18:28.912 --> 18:31.135
No one can ruin its peace and stability.

18:33.552 --> 18:34.958
How do you plan to investigate next?

18:35.233 --> 18:36.336
I'll do everything I can to help.

18:39.713 --> 18:40.936
All the clues are gone,

18:41.592 --> 18:42.712
but that just proves

18:42.792 --> 18:44.439
we're on the right track.

18:44.873 --> 18:47.255
Young men in Wanshan County keep dying unexpectedly.

18:47.752 --> 18:50.558
It must be Prince Xiangyang's big secret he's desperate to hide.

18:51.125 --> 18:54.212
Next, I want to open the coffin and examine the body

18:55.193 --> 18:56.879
to find out how Wang Qing died.

18:58.153 --> 18:59.153
All right.

19:02.953 --> 19:03.953
Lord Zhan.

19:05.352 --> 19:06.352
Lord Hu,

19:06.552 --> 19:07.696
the task you gave me

19:08.032 --> 19:09.055
is already done.

19:10.393 --> 19:11.393
Let me guess,

19:11.832 --> 19:15.432
did you have Elder Zhu go through the county's household records

19:15.512 --> 19:19.032
and sort out the list of young men who died unexpectedly in recent years?

19:19.592 --> 19:21.399
I've already sorted it for you, Lord Zhan.

19:21.673 --> 19:22.673
Please take a look.

19:27.713 --> 19:28.713
Lord Hu,

19:29.473 --> 19:32.272
none of Wang Qing's family is here right now.

19:32.352 --> 19:33.639
If we open the coffin without warning,

19:33.873 --> 19:34.896
I'm afraid...

19:35.881 --> 19:37.920
I'll explain to his family later.

19:38.000 --> 19:40.667
Tomorrow, bring the coroner and officers to open the coffin.

19:50.272 --> 19:52.072
- Examine the body.   - Yes, sir.

20:25.913 --> 20:26.936
Magistrate Hu,

20:27.433 --> 20:30.038
there are no signs of poisoning on this man's body.

20:30.256 --> 20:31.656
No wounds from sharp weapons either.

20:31.750 --> 20:33.716
But there are multiple fractures all over.

20:33.993 --> 20:35.278
His chest and abdomen are swollen.

20:35.473 --> 20:36.656
It looks like

20:37.352 --> 20:39.553
broken bones pierced his organs and killed him.

20:39.633 --> 20:41.712
Can you tell if it was an accident or if someone did it?

20:41.792 --> 20:44.633
Looking at the cause of death, it seems like he fell from a high place

20:44.713 --> 20:46.278
or was crushed by something heavy.

20:46.809 --> 20:48.575
But whether it was intentional or not,

20:49.333 --> 20:51.299
I really can't tell.

20:57.312 --> 20:59.113
You are all Wang Qing's neighbors.

20:59.193 --> 21:02.679
Did any of you see Wang Qing with anyone suspicious before he died?

21:04.953 --> 21:07.192
He wasn't home for a while recently.

21:07.272 --> 21:08.958
None of us really saw him around.

21:10.153 --> 21:12.679
Then do you know why he left home?

21:13.512 --> 21:15.313
Mr. Wang Qing went out to work.

21:15.393 --> 21:16.416
He made a lot of money.

21:17.000 --> 21:19.002
You little rascal, always running off when I'm not looking.

21:19.083 --> 21:20.145
Come on, let's go home.

21:21.552 --> 21:23.393
Sir, please wait a moment.

21:24.375 --> 21:25.792
I'd like to ask the child some questions.

21:25.855 --> 21:27.712
What's there to ask? He's just a kid...

21:27.792 --> 21:31.318
Zhao Da Fa! What's that attitude? Letting him answer won't hurt anyone.

21:32.352 --> 21:34.592
Go ahead, ask him.

21:36.272 --> 21:38.679
You said Wang Qing went out to work.

21:39.233 --> 21:41.136
Do you know what kind of work he was doing?

21:44.153 --> 21:46.312
Did he make a lot of money from that job?

21:47.072 --> 21:49.232
He said he could afford to get married, build a big house,

21:49.312 --> 21:50.998
and even promised to buy me candy.

21:56.312 --> 21:58.896
Let's follow the list we made yesterday and head to the next gravesite.

22:02.112 --> 22:04.456
Are we really going to open the coffins of everyone on that list?

22:08.272 --> 22:11.032
Some of them have been dead for years.

22:11.112 --> 22:12.112
Isn't that a bit much?

22:12.592 --> 22:13.913
We have to do it.

22:13.993 --> 22:17.295
We need to figure out if these people died from the same cause.

22:18.832 --> 22:19.832
Yes, sir.

22:34.433 --> 22:35.433
Magistrate Hu,

22:35.673 --> 22:38.399
Liu Er Lang died from a fractured skull.

22:38.633 --> 22:40.992
Isn't that the same as the autopsy report from three years ago?

22:41.072 --> 22:42.318
Why do you have to dig him up again?

22:42.752 --> 22:44.696
You're disturbing my brother's rest in the afterlife.

22:45.032 --> 22:46.032
San Lang, you...

22:48.193 --> 22:50.439
Young man, I understand how you feel.

22:50.832 --> 22:54.192
We're just trying to find the truth so your brother doesn't die in vain.

22:54.272 --> 22:55.472
You're not even from here.

22:55.552 --> 22:56.752
What do you know about the truth?

22:56.832 --> 22:59.153
My brother died because of the Xiuluo Sect's evil ritual.

22:59.233 --> 23:00.913
Magistrate Hu already closed the case.

23:00.993 --> 23:02.278
What more is there to question?

23:02.458 --> 23:03.494
These past two years,

23:03.575 --> 23:06.032
my parents have just started to recover from losing their son.

23:06.116 --> 23:07.568
Now you have to bring up the past all over again.

23:07.649 --> 23:10.049
You outsiders, who even are you?

23:10.130 --> 23:13.049
That monster from the other day almost ran me over and killed me.

23:13.913 --> 23:16.518
Wanshan County has always been peaceful.

23:16.583 --> 23:18.454
But ever since you all arrived, trouble keeps happening.

23:18.535 --> 23:21.232
Did these people bring the monster here?

23:21.312 --> 23:23.072
- Exactly.   - That's right.

23:23.633 --> 23:25.376
You guys, why are you stirring up trouble?

23:26.633 --> 23:27.752
Everyone, listen to me.

23:27.832 --> 23:30.553
Lord Zhan serves at the Kaifeng Tribunal in Dongjing.

23:30.625 --> 23:33.391
He was appointed by the court to come here and investigate.

23:33.673 --> 23:35.192
Everyone in our county

23:35.272 --> 23:36.712
must fully cooperate with him.

23:36.792 --> 23:38.318
From now on, treat him as you would treat me.

23:38.792 --> 23:39.896
Is that clear to everyone?

23:41.993 --> 23:43.192
My youngest son

23:43.272 --> 23:45.119
is also on that list.

23:45.752 --> 23:47.873
If anyone dares dig up my son's grave,

23:47.953 --> 23:49.318
I'll fight them to the death.

23:49.713 --> 23:50.752
Magistrate Hu,

23:50.832 --> 23:53.032
we've always respected you

23:53.112 --> 23:54.112
and held you in high regard.

23:54.393 --> 23:58.633
But you can't just let your friends do whatever they want in our county.

23:58.713 --> 24:02.958
- That's right!   - Kick them out!

24:05.633 --> 24:07.952
Lord Zhan, the dead deserve respect.

24:08.032 --> 24:09.512
I was worried

24:09.592 --> 24:11.616
that the people would have this kind of resentment.

24:12.312 --> 24:13.376
Given how things look now,

24:13.792 --> 24:15.313
if we keep insisting on digging up graves,

24:15.393 --> 24:16.798
we might get ourselves into trouble.

24:17.473 --> 24:19.478
Maybe we should wait a couple of days.

24:28.993 --> 24:29.993
You're back.

24:41.272 --> 24:42.416
Let me guess.

24:43.153 --> 24:44.639
You didn't find much, did you?

24:46.913 --> 24:47.936
So, you didn't bother going.

24:49.112 --> 24:50.793
I saw that Senior Zhu went,

24:50.873 --> 24:51.873
so I didn't go myself.

24:55.072 --> 24:56.295
You suspect Zhu Ming Yuan too?

24:56.867 --> 24:58.450
Looks like you've been suspicious for a while.

24:59.112 --> 25:01.232
I'm sure you could've dodged Luo Chang Shui's move.

25:01.312 --> 25:02.569
Why would you need him to step in?

25:03.032 --> 25:04.952
With his skills, even if he wanted to save someone,

25:05.032 --> 25:06.431
why would he need to kill Luo Chang Shui?

25:09.312 --> 25:10.312
Come on.

25:11.072 --> 25:13.873
I've read this "Pulse Manual" cover to cover twice now.

25:13.953 --> 25:15.998
When I check a pulse now, I'm about 70 to 80% accurate.

25:21.752 --> 25:23.159
Those green marks on your body...

25:23.673 --> 25:24.673
Have they spread?

25:27.233 --> 25:29.176
- Let me take a look.   - There's nothing to see.

25:29.592 --> 25:30.592
It looks the same as before.

25:30.913 --> 25:31.913
Young master.

25:33.193 --> 25:34.313
Don't let anything slip.

25:34.393 --> 25:36.913
Young master, I heard you spent the whole day digging graves.

25:36.994 --> 25:38.794
I'll go fetch some water. You should get cleaned up.

25:38.875 --> 25:39.875
All right.

25:44.153 --> 25:45.335
What's the harm in me taking a look?

25:47.433 --> 25:48.433
I'm dying of thirst.

26:17.352 --> 26:19.552
Did you kill Luo Chang Shui?

26:19.792 --> 26:21.439
He was just a piece of rotten meat.

26:22.352 --> 26:25.278
Was he really worth all this fuss and dragging everyone out here?

26:25.552 --> 26:26.656
If he hadn't died,

26:27.393 --> 26:29.833
the secret of Wanshan County would've been exposed.

26:29.913 --> 26:31.096
The reason I came this time

26:31.473 --> 26:33.919
was to keep an eye on Zhan Zhao and the others.

26:35.552 --> 26:36.879
Did they find anything?

26:37.272 --> 26:38.998
They weren't supposed to find anything,

26:40.473 --> 26:42.232
but you all just had to get clever

26:42.312 --> 26:44.119
and send Luo Chang Shui over.

26:44.312 --> 26:46.478
You ended up ruining my plans.

26:48.032 --> 26:49.399
We're both working for the same master.

26:50.953 --> 26:52.718
You'd better watch your tone.

26:54.312 --> 26:55.718
Look at you.

26:57.393 --> 26:59.558
It's like you don't even care about the master at all.

27:06.032 --> 27:07.679
Wanshan County holds

27:08.592 --> 27:10.439
the master's fate in its hands.

27:10.953 --> 27:13.518
That's why I can talk like this.

27:14.633 --> 27:16.073
He promised

27:16.153 --> 27:18.399
to keep the county safe and peaceful.

27:18.752 --> 27:19.856
But look at things now.

27:27.312 --> 27:29.639
Zhong Shou has stirred up all kinds of trouble.

27:30.032 --> 27:31.439
With Zhan Zhao's abilities,

27:32.112 --> 27:34.933
he'll get to the bottom of all this sooner or later

27:35.032 --> 27:37.679
and connect it to what happened ten years ago.

27:38.233 --> 27:40.616
Tell the master to get ready.

27:44.473 --> 27:45.473
Say something, will you?

27:46.312 --> 27:48.335
Quiet. I'm reciting the formula.

27:49.592 --> 27:50.775
So, does it actually work or not?

27:52.752 --> 27:53.752
Zhu Zi,

27:55.272 --> 27:56.376
this is bad.

27:58.032 --> 28:00.072
What is it? What about me?

28:00.376 --> 28:01.832
You ate too many plums and now you're overheated.

28:01.913 --> 28:03.560
Zhao Zhi Er bought all of these.

28:04.367 --> 28:06.047
Are you sure you know how to check a pulse?

28:07.792 --> 28:09.272
Have you checked my young master's pulse?

28:09.352 --> 28:10.352
How is he?

28:13.112 --> 28:14.992
He's doing fine. It's not getting any worse.

28:15.072 --> 28:16.072
Really?

28:20.458 --> 28:24.463
- Take it outside and let it soak up some moonlight.   - Moonlight?

28:24.953 --> 28:26.833
These two little seedlings need to get

28:26.913 --> 28:29.232
98 hours of sunlight and moonlight

28:29.312 --> 28:30.456
before they'll bloom.

28:31.512 --> 28:32.512
Go on.

28:33.272 --> 28:34.272
Take them to the pavilion.

28:52.072 --> 28:55.038
You're busy with this case, working yourself to exhaustion every day.

28:55.433 --> 28:57.393
Ming Zhu Er doesn't even dare speak up against you,

28:57.473 --> 28:58.798
so he just quietly worries.

28:59.193 --> 29:01.512
I even saw him wiping away tears in secret yesterday.

29:01.592 --> 29:03.752
Take a break for a couple of days for his sake, at least.

29:05.312 --> 29:07.159
All right, I promise.

29:08.032 --> 29:10.318
Once we get to Gucheng County, I won't make a move unless I have to.

29:10.752 --> 29:12.153
I'll leave the fighting to you guys.

29:12.233 --> 29:13.335
Gucheng County?

29:13.592 --> 29:15.199
Who said you could go to Gucheng County?

29:16.713 --> 29:17.713
Just hear me out.

29:18.473 --> 29:20.272
If there's really a spy in the county office,

29:20.352 --> 29:23.238
then everything we do is definitely being watched.

29:23.832 --> 29:26.113
I'm afraid we won't find any more clues in Wanshan County.

29:26.193 --> 29:29.153
Do you remember what I told you earlier about the Jin Niang case?

29:29.673 --> 29:31.238
Jin Niang's husband, Duan Shi Lang,

29:31.552 --> 29:33.359
went missing while still in his prime.

29:33.792 --> 29:35.159
Luo Chang Shui and Zhong Shou

29:35.433 --> 29:37.798
are also tied to the case from ten years ago, now that you mention it.

29:38.112 --> 29:40.873
So, instead of staying stuck in Wanshan County,

29:40.953 --> 29:43.478
why not try a different approach and look into what happened ten years ago?

29:44.153 --> 29:46.712
Zhao Yue An had no grudge against Jin Niang.

29:46.792 --> 29:48.318
Why would he kill a woman?

29:49.312 --> 29:50.312
His motive

29:50.633 --> 29:52.038
is worth digging into.

29:53.393 --> 29:54.992
If I weren't tied up with official duties,

29:55.072 --> 29:57.679
I'd really want to go with you and check out Gucheng County.

29:58.233 --> 29:59.553
I hope your trip goes smoothly.

29:59.633 --> 30:01.038
Bring back some clues if you can.

30:01.332 --> 30:03.352
If you need my help, just let me know anytime.

30:03.552 --> 30:04.998
Actually, I do need your help.

30:06.167 --> 30:07.573
I want to go there and come back quickly,

30:07.713 --> 30:09.432
so I'm asking you to help look after

30:09.512 --> 30:11.913
those two little rascals, Ming Zhu Er and Zhao Zhi Er.

30:11.993 --> 30:13.558
All right, don't worry.

30:13.873 --> 30:15.032
Fish for sale!

30:15.112 --> 30:17.199
Come take a look, fresh fish!

30:18.193 --> 30:19.255
Sir.

30:20.633 --> 30:21.735
Give me a better price.

30:23.042 --> 30:24.482
This one will do.

30:24.712 --> 30:26.031
That Lv Zhu you mentioned,

30:26.112 --> 30:27.679
I know where his house is.

30:28.112 --> 30:29.439
I'm going to confront him

30:29.873 --> 30:31.798
and get the body back.

30:33.032 --> 30:35.038
Thanks for letting me know about this.

30:35.592 --> 30:41.119
Now, Jin Niang and Shi Lang can finally be reunited.

30:42.312 --> 30:43.312
Granny,

30:43.592 --> 30:44.833
from what you're saying,

30:44.913 --> 30:46.518
you've found Shi Lang's whereabouts?

30:47.433 --> 30:50.038
Well, we managed to recover half his remains.

30:50.512 --> 30:55.919
Honestly, being able to get the body back is all thanks to Jin Niang.

30:56.352 --> 30:59.119
Back then, Shi Lang went out to work

30:59.393 --> 31:01.238
and lost contact with his family.

31:01.953 --> 31:04.318
Jin Niang went out looking for him.

31:04.458 --> 31:07.225
Back then, I was staying at my eldest son's place.

31:08.112 --> 31:10.679
Jin Niang had someone send me a message.

31:11.519 --> 31:12.703
She said she had found

31:12.993 --> 31:15.079
Shi Lang working at Jiuzhou Mountain.

31:15.473 --> 31:18.113
By the time we found Shi Lang,

31:18.193 --> 31:23.393
he and about a dozen young men around his age

31:23.473 --> 31:26.798
were covered by just a thin layer of dirt

31:27.352 --> 31:29.758
and dumped in a mass grave.

31:33.473 --> 31:35.518
This case just keeps getting more mysterious.

31:36.633 --> 31:37.696
What kind of work

31:37.777 --> 31:39.777
would cause so many young men to die all at once?

31:39.875 --> 31:41.208
It's truly baffling.

31:41.875 --> 31:43.555
Some of these dead young men

31:43.625 --> 31:46.144
were probably the ones Zhong Shou mentioned

31:46.208 --> 31:47.458
who were meant for ghost marriages.

31:48.752 --> 31:50.192
The deaths of these young men

31:50.272 --> 31:52.038
affected many counties in Xiangzhou.

31:52.752 --> 31:55.518
It lasted for a whole decade.

31:56.473 --> 31:58.833
Where do we go next? Jiuzhou Mountain?

31:58.917 --> 32:00.025
It's been ten years.

32:00.125 --> 32:02.149
There's probably nothing left in these mountains.

32:02.512 --> 32:03.512
Let's go to the Zhao family.

32:03.993 --> 32:04.993
I've got a theory.

32:05.272 --> 32:06.998
Whatever those young men were working on

32:07.233 --> 32:08.718
might be connected to the Zhao family.

32:09.552 --> 32:10.552
If that's the case,

32:10.913 --> 32:14.359
Zhao Yue An probably killed Jin Niang to keep her quiet.

32:35.958 --> 32:37.677
Look at all these bags and bundles.

32:37.750 --> 32:38.792
I thought coming along

32:38.873 --> 32:40.936
would let me catch the Zhao family's dirty business.

32:41.292 --> 32:43.395
Turns out they're just here to burn paper for their ancestors.

33:06.083 --> 33:07.338
Why aren't they worshiping this one?

33:23.592 --> 33:26.272
This Zhao Yue An isn't exactly his father's favorite, is he?

33:26.352 --> 33:29.352
Back then, Master Zhao really doted on this youngest son.

33:29.633 --> 33:30.998
Then, why not pay respects to him?

33:38.292 --> 33:40.235
My master and I have both cheated death once.

33:40.713 --> 33:42.199
All thanks to you.

33:42.592 --> 33:44.079
Survived death once.

33:46.272 --> 33:48.399
Maybe the "master" Luo Chang Shui mentioned

33:49.032 --> 33:50.439
wasn't actually Qiu Han.

33:53.832 --> 33:55.199
What if Zhao Yue An isn't really dead?

33:55.953 --> 33:57.278
What if this is just an empty grave?

34:23.592 --> 34:25.313
The news of Zhao Yue An's sudden death

34:25.393 --> 34:27.335
definitely came from the Zhao family.

34:27.673 --> 34:30.432
Even though they've destroyed all the evidence from the Jin Niang case,

34:30.500 --> 34:34.084
Zhao Yue An's motive for killing Jin Niang can't be erased.

34:35.072 --> 34:37.255
If someone insists on taking this to the county office,

34:37.713 --> 34:41.376
the Zhao family's dirty business they're trying to hide will be exposed.

34:42.633 --> 34:44.119
The son kills to silence witnesses,

34:44.673 --> 34:47.015
and the father helps his son fake his death.

34:47.792 --> 34:49.639
Those two really are thick as thieves.

34:49.873 --> 34:51.752
I wonder if the officials in Gucheng County

34:51.832 --> 34:53.399
are loyal to the Prince of Xiangyang.

34:53.592 --> 34:54.952
If we rush to the yamen

34:55.032 --> 34:56.798
and ask for an order to interrogate Zhao Zheng De,

34:57.592 --> 34:58.616
that might not be wise.

35:03.792 --> 35:04.792
Forget it.

35:05.673 --> 35:06.735
Let's get some rest soon.

35:17.233 --> 35:18.998
Where can we even go this early?

35:21.713 --> 35:22.750
Giddy up!

35:26.798 --> 35:27.832
Giddy up!

35:32.953 --> 35:35.399
I just can't stand the way you run around everywhere.

35:36.458 --> 35:38.583
Zhao Zheng De. I've brought the person out for you.

35:38.668 --> 35:40.114
If you have questions, ask.

35:43.164 --> 35:44.191
Go on, ask.

35:44.272 --> 35:46.588
I've already brought them out. You want me to take them back or what?

35:53.393 --> 35:55.536
If we didn't have solid leads,

35:55.833 --> 35:57.559
we wouldn't have come to you directly.

35:57.753 --> 35:58.753
Let me give you some advice.

35:58.833 --> 35:59.935
Answer the questions honestly.

36:03.913 --> 36:05.199
Who are you people?

36:05.672 --> 36:07.793
Why are you digging into things from ten years ago?

36:07.873 --> 36:09.815
Are you questioning us, or are we questioning you?

36:10.112 --> 36:11.112
What do you mean who?

36:11.632 --> 36:13.079
We're notorious outlaws.

36:17.125 --> 36:18.766
You think those two don't look the part?

36:18.847 --> 36:20.046
You got it wrong.

36:20.127 --> 36:21.413
They're the bosses of the outlaws.

36:21.753 --> 36:23.358
Otherwise, how could they order me around?

36:24.833 --> 36:26.753
Boss, let me borrow your sword.

36:31.273 --> 36:32.592
Can you just answer properly?

36:32.672 --> 36:34.318
Yes.

36:38.433 --> 36:39.433
I admit it.

36:40.249 --> 36:41.849
Back then, I set up the scheme

36:41.930 --> 36:43.690
for Yue An to fake his death.

36:43.833 --> 36:45.353
But this thing you're talking about,

36:45.433 --> 36:47.953
the one that killed a dozen people.

36:48.192 --> 36:50.001
I honestly have no idea what it was.

36:50.083 --> 36:51.729
Zhao Yue An was only 16 back then.

36:52.503 --> 36:54.470
He hired all those laborers to work.

36:54.786 --> 36:56.065
You really didn't know?

36:56.164 --> 36:57.685
I truly didn't know.

36:57.833 --> 37:00.072
I also didn't know what Yue An was doing in the mountains...

37:00.152 --> 37:01.152
Mountains?

37:01.681 --> 37:02.927
So it really was you guys.

37:03.393 --> 37:04.718
Was the business in the mountains

37:05.301 --> 37:06.618
run by Zhao Yue An?

37:09.512 --> 37:10.512
I don't know.

37:11.456 --> 37:12.456
I don't know.

37:12.667 --> 37:15.587
Boss, he really doesn't know anything. Let's just kill him.

37:17.958 --> 37:20.733
I'll talk!

37:22.917 --> 37:23.917
Yue An

37:26.000 --> 37:27.607
is not my biological son.

37:28.592 --> 37:30.265
He's the illegitimate child of someone important

37:30.552 --> 37:32.599
who was raised in my home as a foster child.

37:46.592 --> 37:48.758
There are so many wealthy families in Xiangzhou,

37:49.273 --> 37:51.616
yet they chose to place their illegitimate child with the Zhao family.

37:52.512 --> 37:53.735
This important person

37:54.232 --> 37:55.639
must also have the surname Zhao, right?

37:57.873 --> 37:59.599
Could he be the Prince of Xiangyang's son?

37:59.953 --> 38:01.016
Where is he now?

38:01.592 --> 38:02.815
I don't know.

38:04.112 --> 38:06.335
After Yue An faked his death, he was taken away.

38:06.953 --> 38:08.592
I never saw him again.

38:08.672 --> 38:10.318
You raised him for over ten years, after all.

38:10.616 --> 38:12.003
You must've tried to find him in secret.

38:12.273 --> 38:13.273
Be honest.

38:14.313 --> 38:15.313
Yes.

38:16.512 --> 38:17.735
I couldn't bear to let him go.

38:18.953 --> 38:20.559
But I couldn't find him either.

38:21.072 --> 38:22.072
I heard

38:23.152 --> 38:25.159
Yue An has already changed his name and identity

38:25.592 --> 38:27.959
and is hiding out with a wealthy family in Xiangzhou.

38:28.353 --> 38:29.838
They live in a remote area,

38:30.032 --> 38:32.398
but they're still a prestigious clan.

38:32.913 --> 38:34.152
As long as he's not suffering,

38:34.232 --> 38:35.415
I'm at ease.

38:36.112 --> 38:37.398
What's this family's surname?

38:38.833 --> 38:40.896
- I don't know.   - Where in Xiangzhou?

38:41.753 --> 38:42.753
I think...

38:44.473 --> 38:46.753
It's called Huilong River

38:46.833 --> 38:48.712
but I don't know exactly where.

38:51.208 --> 38:52.848
As long as we know the place, it's easy.

38:52.917 --> 38:54.317
Huilong River is a small place.

38:54.417 --> 38:55.958
There aren't many big families there.

38:56.032 --> 38:57.860
Even if we have to check every house,

38:57.958 --> 39:00.038
we'll find Zhao Yue An.

39:09.465 --> 39:11.887
But Xiao Chen and I have never seen Zhao Yue An.

39:12.192 --> 39:13.599
We probably wouldn't recognize him.

39:17.873 --> 39:18.935
Seriously?

39:19.632 --> 39:22.353
Zhao Yue An was never like those spoiled brats.

39:22.433 --> 39:23.913
Except for the Jin Niang case,

39:23.993 --> 39:25.289
he never caused any trouble.

39:25.375 --> 39:26.458
He also rarely showed his face.

39:28.112 --> 39:29.393
So it seems

39:29.473 --> 39:31.278
the Prince of Xiangyang planned it this way.

39:40.672 --> 39:41.959
Do you want to see Zhao Yue An?

39:44.265 --> 39:45.551
Leave a message for your family

39:46.333 --> 39:47.395
and come with us.

39:52.375 --> 39:53.375
Here you go.

40:03.292 --> 40:05.011
What's wrong? Why the long face?

40:07.958 --> 40:10.044
Linglong Manor is right near Huilong River.

40:11.353 --> 40:13.472
So doesn't that mean we don't have to drag Mr. Zhao around

40:13.552 --> 40:16.096
to knock on every rich family's door anymore?

40:16.473 --> 40:17.713
Think carefully.

40:17.793 --> 40:20.793
Which wealthy sons returned to Huilong River ten years ago?

40:20.873 --> 40:22.918
At the time of the incident, Zhao Yue An was only 16.

40:23.753 --> 40:24.895
Ten years have passed.

40:26.273 --> 40:27.838
He's 26 now.

40:28.512 --> 40:29.512
Who comes to mind?

40:32.753 --> 40:33.753
Shao Ji Zu.

40:34.632 --> 40:36.278
The Shao family has three sons.

40:37.186 --> 40:38.985
Shao Ji Zu is the youngest.

40:39.083 --> 40:40.443
He was raised outside the family.

40:40.528 --> 40:41.769
Later, one of his two brothers

40:41.850 --> 40:43.273
died and the other one became disabled,

40:43.417 --> 40:44.900
That was why he returned to the main family.

40:45.793 --> 40:47.398
He was 16 that year.

40:47.672 --> 40:49.592
No need to check further. It has to be him.

40:49.672 --> 40:50.999
No wonder the Prince of Xiangyang

40:51.433 --> 40:53.696
was so eager to arrange his marriage with the Huo family.

40:54.313 --> 40:56.672
But if it's really him, why are you worried?

40:58.473 --> 41:00.199
Tang is also 26 this year.

41:00.473 --> 41:01.656
Coincidentally,

41:01.873 --> 41:03.519
he also returned to Huilong River

41:03.833 --> 41:05.119
when he was 16.

41:05.353 --> 41:08.238
Even though the Tang Sect sided with the Prince of Xiangyang ten years ago,

41:08.753 --> 41:09.992
I still think

41:10.072 --> 41:11.753
it's unlikely for Tang to be the one.

41:11.833 --> 41:14.295
The Prince of Xiangyang could never have a kid as good as Tang.

41:21.152 --> 41:22.255
Anyone else?

41:23.192 --> 41:24.375
There's one more.

41:24.632 --> 41:26.079
He was sickly as a child.

41:26.833 --> 41:28.878
The fortune teller said he shouldn't stay with his family.

41:30.353 --> 41:32.838
So he had always been raised by distant relatives.

41:34.913 --> 41:36.318
When he turned 16,

41:36.672 --> 41:37.855
his relatives passed away.

41:38.953 --> 41:40.559
Only then could he return to his own family.

41:42.592 --> 41:44.798
And this year, he's also 26.

41:47.192 --> 41:48.415
That person is my brother,

41:49.393 --> 41:50.393
Huo Feng.

41:51.592 --> 41:52.999
No way that's your brother.

41:53.512 --> 41:56.193
Think about Shao Ji Zu's annoying face.

41:56.292 --> 41:57.538
He must take after his father.

41:57.873 --> 42:01.159
Even his name, Ji Zu, sounds like it has an agenda.

42:03.632 --> 42:06.152
Master Bai's analysis this time actually makes sense.

42:06.793 --> 42:08.632
Mocking Shao Ji Zu's looks

42:08.712 --> 42:10.199
and his name all at once,

42:10.552 --> 42:11.878
and that's called making sense?

42:13.993 --> 42:15.758
Honestly, I really think

42:15.953 --> 42:18.592
it's most likely Shao Ji Zu.

42:18.953 --> 42:19.953
No need to guess anymore.

42:20.232 --> 42:22.072
Let's just take this old master with us

42:22.152 --> 42:24.758
and knock on the Shao family's door to see if he calls him "Dad".

42:26.393 --> 42:27.645
Let's not worry about that for now.

42:28.042 --> 42:30.226
Once we're back in Wanshan County, we'll figure it out.

42:30.672 --> 42:31.833
Speaking of which,

42:31.913 --> 42:33.136
let's make a plan first.

42:33.505 --> 42:34.519
When we get back to Wanshan County,

42:34.600 --> 42:36.361
don't let him anywhere near the yamen.

42:36.442 --> 42:37.784
We worked hard to get him out.

42:37.917 --> 42:39.364
What if a spy gets to him?

42:40.583 --> 42:41.583
All right.

42:41.833 --> 42:42.833
He's all yours.

42:50.353 --> 42:52.999
Yes. It has been years since something like this happened in our county.

43:00.112 --> 43:01.112
Let's go check it out.

43:02.273 --> 43:03.455
I'll keep an eye on Zhao Zheng De.

43:04.273 --> 43:05.560
- Giddy up.   - Giddy up.

43:05.584 --> 43:07.584
MvDrama.net
